  "goodToKnow": "Der Mordfall is a murder case. German law distinguishes Mord, killing with specific aggravating features (Mordmerkmale) such as greed or cruelty, punished with life imprisonment, from Totschlag (manslaughter). Murder has no statute of limitations, so old cases (Cold Cases) can be reopened with DNA evidence. The police unit is die Mordkommission. Plural: die Mordfälle."
